7fb016a0/patterns-going-full-screen-thumbnail%402x.png","line":63},{"title":"Enable intuitive interactions","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Enable-intuitive-interactions","line":65},{"title":"Physical controllers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Physical-controllers","line":78},{"title":"Touch controls","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Touch-controls","line":80},{"title":"![A sketch of a D-pad control from a game controller, suggesting gameplay. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/36867292ccfd45e0f937f522d7e214f7/inputs-game-controls-thumbnail%402x.png","line":82},{"title":"![A sketch of a pointing hand swiping in a curved motion toward the right, suggesting touch interaction with a device. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ca100cc13bcc2fbb7168bebc1da95af8/inputs-gestures-thumbnail%402x.png","line":84},{"title":"![A sketch of an arrow-shaped pointer, suggesting use of a mouse or trackpad. The image is tinted purple to subtly reflect the purple in the original six-color Apple logo.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/69b91fbe2b281f7b638d380a3a6aa416/inputs-pointing-devices-thumbnail%402x.png","line":86},{"title":"Welcome everyone","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/designing-for-games#Welcome-everyone","line":88},{"title":"Apple accessibility technologies","target":"https://developer.apple.com/accessibility/","line":105},{"title":"Unity plug-ins","target":"https://github.com/Apple/UnityPlugins","line":105},{"title":"![A sketch of the Accessibility icon. The image is tinted yellow to subtly reflect the yello